Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:00:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.35,0:01:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我全都记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,韦伯上尉 早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Webb. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有人给你解释过一切了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has everything been explained to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.85,0:01:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.82,0:01:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,等结束以后 你就不再是大卫·韦伯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we are finished with you, you will no longer be David Webb.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我变成谁都行 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be whoever you need me to be, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你完全清楚 选择留下意味着什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew exactly what it meant for you if you chose to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能逃避你做过的事 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't outrun what you did, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是你造就了你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made yourself into who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,最终你必须面对现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eventually you're gonna have to face the fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.93,0:01:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你是自愿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯蒂安·迪索特 约好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christian Dassault made a reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,希瑟·李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 有一台1993年分配给俄罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, we have a device issued to a stay-behind team
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,新西伯利亚待命队伍的机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Novosibirsk, Russia, in 1993.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,库存清单上的状态为已损坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marked on our inventory as destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,它正在对我们进行正面攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's knocking on our front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.30,0:06:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the status?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人什么也没干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever it is, is just sitting there idle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没有外出流量 什么都没干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no outbound traffic, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们找到了一处后门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've found a back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.27,0:06:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要远程命令环境 我去定位来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need the reverse shell. I'm gonna locate the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我来弄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我们的保密主机受到重大入侵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, people, we have a major breach of our classified mainframe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,放下手头的一切 都去忙这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop everything you're doing, get on it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我这就把命令环境发给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, I'm sending you the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在就要 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Need it right now? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 查找IP地址 - 路由跟踪呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Getting IP. - Where's that traceroute?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.30,0:07:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不明用户 正在监视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unknown user. Monitoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克雅未克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reykjavik.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密行动黑客大本营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SecOps hacking camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,切断那栋楼的电源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill the power to the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,马上进入那里的电网系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get into that power grid now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.49,0:07:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我控制了那栋楼的电力 - 待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've got the power to the building. - Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 十秒 - 我们首先解决这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ten seconds. - Let's get on top of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 切断电力 - 收到 切断电力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut it down. - Copy that. Shutting it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你还能联网吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.75,0:08:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,杜威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've just been hacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,有多严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可能比斯诺登事件更严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be worse than Snowden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,知道是谁干的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there any attribution?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,李说肯定是非常了解我们系统的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee says it must be someone with a deep knowledge of our systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会影响到 深梦和铁手行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could affect Deep Dream, and Iron Hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一小时后在会议室给我报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want a briefing in my conference room in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.13,0:09:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 确认了吗？- 是的 确实有入侵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you get confirmation? - Yeah, there was a hack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们暴露了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So are we exposed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还不清楚 我们还在查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know yet. We're checking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,给杜威打电话 安排在华盛顿见一次面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to call Dewey. Set up a meet in DC.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,亚伦 现在是关键时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaron, we got a lot at stake here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们不该再找麻烦了 - 去照做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- maybe we shouldn't rock the boat. - Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.45,0:09:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,乔治 准备好发布了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, George. We ready for the launch?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.47,0:09:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,(305项匹配结果)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(尼基·帕森斯 踏脚石行动)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,希瑟 你认识国家情报局局长吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather, you know the Director of National Intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.17,0:10:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,希瑟·李 网络部 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather Lee, Cyber Ops, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,知道是谁吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you got a name for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.85,0:10:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,黑客是前中情局特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hacker was a former Agency operative.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可能与 克里斯蒂安·迪索特合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believed to be working with Christian Dassault,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.55,0:10:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,曾与杰森·伯恩有关联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and previously linked to Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 他们拿到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jesus Christ. - What did they get?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.75,0:10:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密行动文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black-ops files.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,从踏脚石行动到铁手行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From Treadstone all the way to Iron Hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.60,0:10:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,铁手行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iron Hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.65,0:11:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但它还未实施呢 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not even operational yet, for Christ's sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,尼基·帕森斯 现在在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Nicky Parsons right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.65,0:11:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,她离开了雷克雅未克 经布加勒斯特到雅典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She left Reykjavik, traveling through Bucharest to Athens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.20,0:11:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得她是要去见什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feels like a meet to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们准备怎么处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how are you going to handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,彻底解决此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cut the head off this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我想指挥这次行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I'd like to be point on this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.55,0:11:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你没受过这方面的训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not indoctrinated for this material.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经参与进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm already into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.11,0:11:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我在帕森斯下载的文档中 植入了病毒软件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I embedded malware into Parsons' download.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦有人打开这些文件 我就能跟踪到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When those files are opened, I can trace them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,让我加入吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.33,0:11:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把帕森斯和文件交给你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll deliver Parsons, the files,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果伯恩出现 我也会抓到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, if he's out there, I'll give you Bourne, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我欣赏你的热情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate your enthusiasm,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但不要把你的个人计划 强推给国家情报局局长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but do not push your personal agenda to the DNI again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你应该能帮上忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I think you can help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,本次行动 我让你全权指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to give you full operational control on this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.45,0:12:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,保证你能调用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I will make sure you have access to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.28,0:12:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,相关人员和资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any relevant teams and resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.66,0:12:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你每一步行动都要向我报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want to know every move you make.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.71,0:12:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.45,0:13:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我这边还没完事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not finished here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,杰森·伯恩出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason Bourne is in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在哪儿 - 雅典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where? - Athens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快把罗马的事解决掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close your account in Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.05,0:16:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,李通过视频监控查到了线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee got a hit from a CCTV feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,半小时前 帕森斯坐上一辆开往雅典西部的公交车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parsons boarded a bus a half-hour ago, headed west across Athens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,两个小组已经在路上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got two local teams en route.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找到伯恩了吗 - 还没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any sign of Bourne? - Not so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到 他跟这件事有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's involved in this somehow. I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,上传雅典所有的视频信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Upload all Athens data and feeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.05,0:16:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,激活实时处理程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and activate real-time processing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,进展如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,帕森斯坐的公交车 刚到宪法广场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parsons' bus has just arrived at Syntagma Square.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:16:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,希腊议会前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a demonstration
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:17:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有游行示威活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in front of the Greek parliament building.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为 她是想用游行作掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she'll use it as cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,派AB两组去广场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deploy Alpha and Bravo to the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在议会外面的人群中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recon for Parsons in the crowd outside parliament,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,以及任何可能的汇合点 寻找帕森斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and any possible rendezvous points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,明白 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.85,0:17:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 特工已到位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, the Asset has landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A组到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha Team arriving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.30,0:18:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有A组的视频信号了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have the Alpha Team feeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,投到大屏幕上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,雅典警方报告称\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Athens police are reporting
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.42,0:18:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,战术特警正朝游行人群前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tactical teams moving on the demonstrators.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.38,0:18:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,把从广场收发的社交网络信息挑出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isolate all social-media posts from the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.05,0:18:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,回放A1号视频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rewind Alpha One's feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.99,0:19:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 - 二十秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, ma'am. - Twenty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.25,0:19:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好 B2 B4 正在进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Bravo Two, Four, moving in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.43,0:19:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我黑进了中情局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hacked the Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,为了克里斯蒂安·迪索特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Christian Dassault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿到了所有的秘密行动文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got all the black-ops files.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要在网上公开它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're putting them online.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.61,0:19:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.03,0:19:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,往前2秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two seconds forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:19:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,金发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blonde hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,画质增强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enhance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,找到她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.17,0:20:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,在宪法广场发现 尼基·帕森斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicky Parsons sighted in Syntagma Square.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.23,0:20:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,重定向至斯塔迪奥街南\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Redirect south on Stadiou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过 克里斯蒂安·迪索特会害死你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, Christian Dassault is going to get you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们别无选择 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have a choice, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.30,0:20:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,一个新的计划 又开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's started again. A new program.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,铁手行动 比以往的更糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iron Hand. It's even worse than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那跟我有什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that got to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.27,0:20:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,因为它重要 真的重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it matters. It matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.39,0:20:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说 不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to me, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一重要的是活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that matters is staying alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.02,0:20:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,销声匿迹 活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get off the grid, survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我不信 你也不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe that and neither do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.86,0:20:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.95,0:20:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能再这样下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't live like this for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.49,0:20:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,杰森 我来是因为我发现了些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason, I came here because I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.96,0:20:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我在踏脚石行动的文件中 发现了你父亲的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found your father's name in the Treadstone files.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个分析师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was an analyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他没参与行动 他离行动远得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't in Operations. He wasn't near any of that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:20:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你 我看见了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来他直接参与了行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looked like he was involved directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.18,0:21:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不止如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,关于你 还不止如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.72,0:21:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,早在你加入行动之前 他们就在监视你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you joined the program, they were watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,监视我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watching me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你折磨自己太久了 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've tortured yourself for a long time now, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.48,0:21:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你为自己的行为而折磨自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You torture yourself for what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.19,0:21:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不知道 他们对你那么做的真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't know the truth about what they did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你得看看那些文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to read those files.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 他们追踪了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move. They tracked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A1看见两个目标 一男一女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha One has eyes on two targets. One female, one male.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,确认男性的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Identify the male.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A1 我们要确认男性目标的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha One, we need an ID on the male target.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,趁警察还没封锁这一区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to get out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.17,0:21:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the police cut off this part of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,往北走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head north.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.23,0:21:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在雅典娜神像那儿汇合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet me at the statue of Athena.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.69,0:21:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我来对付他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take them with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.99,0:22:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.24,0:22:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.45,0:22:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.37,0:22:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可以交手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear to engage the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.67,0:22:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A组跟紧那名男子 可以交手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha Team, stay with the male. You are clear to engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.94,0:23:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 A组失联了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, Alpha Team comms are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.15,0:23:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟丢了 他把他们干掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've lost him, sir. He's taken them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,找到帕森斯 他会回去找她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find Parsons. He'll come back to get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.24,0:23:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 暴乱在蔓延\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, rioting is spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.90,0:23:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,希腊政府宣布进入紧急状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Greek government is declaring a state of emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,B组 重新锁定帕森斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo Team, we are retargeting Parsons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.20,0:24:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,找到她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.30,0:24:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,分头行动 包围她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Split the team, put her in a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.98,0:26:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,一名符合伯恩特征的疑犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A suspect matching Bourne's description
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.85,0:26:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,偷了警方的摩托车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has stolen a police motorcycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.15,0:26:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他去找帕森斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming for Parsons.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.69,0:26:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,特工怎么还没到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell is the Asset?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.05,0:26:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还有两分钟 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes out, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.00,0:26:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,帕森斯在雅典娜神像附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parsons is at the statue of Athena.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.05,0:26:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.92,0:27:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,B组失联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo Team is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.55,0:27:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 特工马上到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, the Asset is arriving on scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.60,0:27:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把行车记录仪的画面调出来 - 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pull up the dash cam. - Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.05,0:27:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,给我视频信号 我要能直接和特工联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the feed and direct comms to the Asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.80,0:27:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,接近目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engaging targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.75,0:27:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我在访问雅典警方的战术数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm accessing Athens police tactical data.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.37,0:27:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要空中视角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need eyes overhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.00,0:27:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,调用卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring up the satellite suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.29,0:27:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 有一颗米斯蒂和KH-12卫星可用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I'm showing a Misty and a KH-12 satellite available.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.30,0:27:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 用KH-12 - 遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Light up the 12. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.06,0:28:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星视频信号上线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satellite video feed is online.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.23,0:28:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,警方封锁了往北走的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police have blocked the road to the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.11,0:28:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,目标会被迫左转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The target will be forced to turn left.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.79,0:28:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,两百米后有另一处路障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another barricade in 200 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.79,0:28:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,目标再次左转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target turning left again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.68,0:28:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩会前往小巷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne's heading for the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.27,0:28:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,山顶左边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left at the top of the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.20,0:29:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有楼梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stairway.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.10,0:29:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,上山 往东走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up the hill. Heading east.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.70,0:29:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,给我一处攻击点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a strike point
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.10,0:29:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他找到出路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's found a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.68,0:29:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你左边两百米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two hundred meters to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.44,0:29:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,索勒姆街19号 上屋顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}19 Solomou. Get to the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.45,0:29:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,目标会在你视线内经过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target should pass within your line of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.48,0:29:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,索勒姆街19号 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}19 Solomou. Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.45,0:29:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星锁定这些坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Focus the satellites on these coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.70,0:29:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,摩托车出现时 即刻锁定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And give me a lock on the motorcycle when it gets there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.70,0:29:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.45,0:30:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到目标了 他们走蛇街到和谐广场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got the targets. They're approaching Omonia from Fidiou.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.95,0:30:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,往西边看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look west.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.36,0:30:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,长街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The long boulevard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.11,0:30:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,目标将在55秒后到达你的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming at you in 55 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.49,0:30:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.85,0:30:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,特工上线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Asset is online.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.49,0:31:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,目标15秒后到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target"s with you in 15 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.95,0:31:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,5秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.01,0:31:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.18,0:31:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay low!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.97,0:31:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,找机会开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.69,0:31:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,抓好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.20,0:31:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,目标停止活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Targets are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.68,0:32:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.77,0:32:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 警方直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, a police helicopter
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.40,0:32:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在楼顶特工旁边发现三具尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spotted three bodies on the roof near the Asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.20,0:32:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,战术特警马上就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tactical team's on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.37,0:32:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,尼基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicky?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.26,0:32:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.89,0:32:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,雅典警方已进入大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Athens police have entered the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.06,0:33:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,特工 你得马上离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asset, you need to get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.81,0:33:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.44,0:33:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还不知道伯恩的生死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't even know if Bourne's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.82,0:33:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你想失去他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to lose this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.90,0:33:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我是杜威局长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Director Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.30,0:33:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,给你二十秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.96,0:33:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 尼基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Nicky.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.90,0:33:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我这就带你到安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to get you to cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.72,0:33:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.31,0:33:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.39,0:33:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.81,0:33:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我这就过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.12,0:34:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找出克里斯蒂安·迪索特 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get a location on Christian Dassault. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.50,0:34:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他和尼基·帕森斯合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he was working with Nicky Parsons,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.45,0:34:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就能带我们找到杰森·伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he will lead us to Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.46,0:34:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要是植入的病毒软件有线索 就告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And let me know if you get a hit on that malware.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.35,0:34:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我想弄清楚一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, can I clarify one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.20,0:34:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.85,0:35:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,特工认识伯恩吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does the Asset know Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.26,0:35:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这么问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you ask me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.60,0:35:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他在楼顶的行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His behavior on the rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.00,0:35:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,说明他们有联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It suggested a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.40,0:35:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩最后一次回来时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last time Bourne came back,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.11,0:35:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,揭发了黑烟斗行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he exposed the Blackbriar program.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.78,0:35:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,暴露了进行中的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It compromised active operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.80,0:35:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,该特工当时在叙利亚卧底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Asset was in Syria undercover.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.78,0:35:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他被捕 受折磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was captured, tortured,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.54,0:35:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们花了两年时间才救出他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it took two damn years to get him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.10,0:35:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你认为那是伯恩想要文件的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you think that's why Bourne wants the files?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.63,0:35:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他想再曝光一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To go public again?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.96,0:35:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他为什么回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea why he came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.71,0:35:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但他肯定想毁掉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But whatever he's doing, he wants to destroy us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.71,0:35:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不能让这种事发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.51,0:35:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你一有消息就给我打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you give me a call soon as you hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.56,0:35:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.56,0:38:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 有请深梦的创始人和董事长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, the founder and chairman of Deep Dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.82,0:38:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,亚伦·卡鲁尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaron Kalloor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.99,0:38:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都知道 我为何而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all know why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.12,0:38:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要推出一款新平台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be unveiling a new platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.00,0:38:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,它是我们勇敢迈出的新一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We think it is a bold new step
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.23,0:38:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,能让我们更好地服务社会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to allow us to serve our community better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.20,0:38:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们目前的社会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're a community right now
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.21,0:39:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,超越了国家边界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is transcending national boundaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.50,0:39:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有十五亿用户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I think we're 1.5 billion users.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.60,0:39:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,简而言之 我们现在的生态系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a nutshell, as you know, we have an ecosystem
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.80,0:39:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有成千上万个应用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of hundreds of thousands of apps at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.75,0:39:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,新平台的功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what this new platform will do
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.48,0:39:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就是整合用户的数据和偏好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be to integrate users' data and preferences,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.03,0:39:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,利用这些信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and use that information
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.20,0:39:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来丰富并量身定制每位用户的体验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to enrich and tailor-make each unique user experience
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.24,0:39:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这一方法前所未有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a way that is, frankly, unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.79,0:39:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见 有些记者在奋笔疾书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, now, I can see some journalists' pens twitching,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.62,0:39:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 准备提问隐私问题 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ready to ask about privacy. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.04,0:39:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,许多人都担心这一问题 理应如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a concern to many people, and so it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.70,0:39:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,因为隐私对我们来说真的太重要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, this is something that matters to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.45,0:39:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And let me just say, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.21,0:39:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我理解没人想被监视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand nobody wants to feel like they're being watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.40,0:39:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let me just tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.50,0:39:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你来到深梦 选择了我们提供的服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you come to Deep Dream, when you use our service,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.50,0:39:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会监视你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no one will be watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.82,0:40:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卡鲁尔先生 - 这边请 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Kalloor. - Right this way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.65,0:40:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,祝用餐愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.84,0:40:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.34,0:40:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.68,0:40:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,听说股东对新平台很满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear your stockholders were very happy with that new platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.51,0:40:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你被入侵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I heard you got hacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.01,0:40:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're dealing with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.85,0:40:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这影响很大 太冒险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This changes everything. There's too much risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.65,0:40:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.77,0:40:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,亚伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaron,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.32,0:40:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你极有天赋 洞察力也很强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are an extraordinarily gifted and perceptive young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.53,0:40:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应帮我们的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you agreed to help us,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.03,0:40:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你知道有多大的威胁…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was because you understood the very grave threats that...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.83,0:41:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 如果这一协议被公开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea of the shit-storm I'll have on my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.15,0:41:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我将面临什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if this arrangement becomes public?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.25,0:41:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,斯诺登事件 对我的打击已经够大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already took a hit with Snowden,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.89,0:41:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你还想再来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you want more?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.10,0:41:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的敌人变得更狡猾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our enemies have become much more sophisticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.15,0:41:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,只收集大数据已经不够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gathering metadata is no longer adequate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.39,0:41:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要后门来进入你的平台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a back door into your new platform,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.92,0:41:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一条能绕开加密体系的捷径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a way past the encryptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.70,0:41:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,如果还不够 你还会提新的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when that's not enough, you'll want something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.23,0:41:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白 是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.00,0:41:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,隐私就是自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Privacy is freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.90,0:41:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你该考虑保护它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that's something you should think about defending.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.10,0:41:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You little prick,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.20,0:41:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你的公司刚起步时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you didn't believe in privacy or freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.65,0:41:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你可没想什么隐私和自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when we funded your startup,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.05,0:41:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们的资助 让你成为亿万富翁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}turned you into a billionaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.16,0:41:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经还给你了 翻了很多倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I paid you back many, many, many times over.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.08,0:41:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直很不愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I was never comfortable with any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.66,0:41:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我不干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.67,0:41:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再出卖用户了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm done selling out our customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.21,0:41:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可你却愿意出卖国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you would sell out your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.17,0:41:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 要不是你感到有风险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is, we wouldn't be having this conversation
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.09,0:41:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会来跟我见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you didn't feel personally at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.34,0:41:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你口口声声说什么自由的因特网\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talk about a free Internet,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.75,0:41:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什么自己在拯救世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you tell yourself you're saving the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.76,0:42:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,其实你只是让世界变得更危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but all you're doing is making it a much more dangerous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.73,0:42:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 你也让保卫国家的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're sure as hell making
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.59,0:42:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越艰难了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this country much more difficult to defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.36,0:42:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这些当然都要算到你头上 亚伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're sure as hell accountable for that, Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.44,0:42:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,都算到你头上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accountable.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.09,0:44:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.80,0:44:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,所有东西都放到桌上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.07,0:44:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.78,0:45:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.00,0:45:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩露面了 在柏林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne has surfaced. In Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.25,0:45:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,叫柏林的小组行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the Berlin team up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.33,0:45:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.92,0:45:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.63,0:46:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,她知道有风险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She knew the risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.26,0:46:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warned her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.68,0:46:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她自己做了选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She made a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.76,0:46:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你利用了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You exploited her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.37,0:46:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,柏林的小组出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Berlin team is mobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.00,0:46:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在什么位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we have on the location?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.50,0:46:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,地址跟克里斯蒂安·迪索特有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an address linked to Christian Dassault.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.37,0:46:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything on Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.50,0:46:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没消息 我在连接视频监控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing yet. I'm accessing CCTV now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.04,0:46:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我在想 我们是不是弄错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I've been thinking, maybe we've got this wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.72,0:46:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他不是冲着我们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if he's not coming for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.72,0:46:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是其他事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if it's something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.22,0:46:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不知道他是什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have any idea who you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.03,0:47:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该合作 伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should work together, Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.66,0:47:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你暴露了黑烟斗项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You exposed the Blackbriar program.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.45,0:47:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的目标一致 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're both after the same thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.41,0:47:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都想扳倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both want to take down
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.76,0:47:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,控制社会的腐败机构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the corrupt institutions that control society.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.54,0:47:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你不是一边的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.52,0:47:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,已连入视频监控系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CCTV feed is online.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.03,0:47:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他在用电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.50,0:47:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.00,0:47:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,如果文件到了网上 行动就暴露了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he puts those files online, operations will be compromised
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.40,0:47:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,会死人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and people will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.33,0:47:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.75,0:47:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等你完事了 好歹把文件留给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least when you're done, leave me the files.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.30,0:48:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这些计划都要曝光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These programs have to be exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.59,0:48:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,人民有权知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People have a right to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.40,0:48:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,得连上他的电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need that computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.82,0:48:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,屋里有部手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a phone in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.57,0:48:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我能通过手机删除文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can use it to delete the files.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.52,0:49:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 连上手机了 - 行动小组呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got the phone. - Where's that team?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.44,0:49:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,5分钟后到 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five minutes out, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.86,0:49:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,来不及了 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're running out of time. Get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.19,0:49:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.82,0:49:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've done something.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.28,0:49:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.41,0:49:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that came at a cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.08,0:50:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天你会明白的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day you'll understand why.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.96,0:50:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我得回华盛顿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta get back to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.42,0:50:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.14,0:51:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们打起来了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're fighting, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.49,0:51:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一道防火墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more firewall.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.18,0:51:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,文件删除了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Files deleted, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.22,0:51:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,打电话过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call in.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.35,0:52:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩 我叫希瑟·李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne, my name is Heather Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.85,0:52:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是负责人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not in charge here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.43,0:52:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你失踪的时候我不在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't here when you went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.65,0:52:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到 你在查阅以前的踏脚石文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see you're going through the old Treadstone files.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.35,0:52:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你在回溯你的过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retracing your history.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.24,0:52:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在寻找什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're looking for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.36,0:52:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me help you find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.66,0:52:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,把电话给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.09,0:52:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.88,0:53:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,杰森 我是罗伯特·杜威 还记得我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason, this is Robert Dewey. Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.85,0:53:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,杰森 你爸爸是爱国者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason, your dad was a patriot.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.43,0:53:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他早就知道 美国面临威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could see the threats that America was facing,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.10,0:53:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,像你一样 他出于巨大的使命感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, like you, he chose to serve his country
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.52,0:53:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,选择了为国效命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out of a profound sense of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.36,0:53:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会希望你破坏中情局的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would not want to see you harm the Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.03,0:53:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你得住手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.70,0:53:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就得住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you have to stop it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.08,0:53:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 预计还有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, our ETA is...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.98,0:53:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他在移动了 准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on the move. Be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.12,0:54:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take point!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.33,0:54:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.46,0:54:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,电梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.96,0:55:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟丢了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost him, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.19,0:55:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,马尔科姆·史密斯 承包商 常驻伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Malcolm Smith, contract only, based out of London.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.86,0:55:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,90年代招募伯恩的时候 踏脚石的监视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ran all of Treadstone's surveillance in the late '90s,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.90,0:55:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,都是他负责的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when Bourne was recruited.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.40,0:55:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活动吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he still active?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.66,0:55:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,改行做私人安保了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's private security now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.20,0:55:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,联系特工 告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact the Asset and tell him
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.75,0:55:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,六个小时内要到伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him on the ground in London in six hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.75,0:55:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为不该这么做 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that could be a mistake, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.25,0:55:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不应该 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mistake? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.58,0:55:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对伯恩究竟是抓是杀 还存在争议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is an argument for catching Bourne instead of killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.26,0:55:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,来说说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.05,0:55:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩消失了很久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne's been off the grid for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.01,0:55:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直藏在阴影中 他经历过很多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been hiding in the shadows, he's seen things.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.68,0:55:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道的信息 能帮助我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows things that could help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.06,0:55:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,带他回来才是明智的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bringing him back in is the smart move.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.19,0:55:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么带他回来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how are we going to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.89,0:55:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔伯特·赫奇在伯恩逃离时做了心理评估\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albert Hirsch wrote the psychal evaluation when Bourne left the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.90,0:56:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他认为伯恩心里依然爱国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He concluded Bourne is still a patriot at heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.69,0:56:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,离开计划这件事 会一直纠缠着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that leaving the program could come back to haunt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.99,0:56:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what are you suggesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.74,0:56:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我注意到伯恩看了这些文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I watched Bourne with those files.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.58,0:56:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他拼命寻找过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Desperately looking into his past.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.41,0:56:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他快到临界点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I think he's at a tipping point.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.63,0:56:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能当面跟他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I could get face-to-face with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.35,0:56:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我可以带他回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I can bring him back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.80,0:56:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就试一次看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.25,0:56:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if it fails,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.47,0:56:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,再由你们处置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you do what you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.10,0:56:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得可以 你呢 鲍伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it makes sense to me. What do you think, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.94,0:56:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,让她试试吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.15,0:56:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.02,0:56:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,要么带伯恩回来 要么就干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring Bourne in, or tie it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.78,0:56:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这次必须了结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.90,0:56:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.08,0:57:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 抱歉…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.25,0:57:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.67,0:57:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,去睡会儿吧 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better get some sleep, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.30,0:57:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你接下来的24小时 会很漫长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a long 24 hours ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.05,0:57:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.95,0:57:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,拖得太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's taking too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.05,0:57:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,都快发布了 还有这么多问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It shouldn't still be buggy this close to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.57,0:57:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得问题不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't think it's buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.66,0:57:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们做的修改\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we've changed some things
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.30,0:57:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,改变了一些参数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's going to change the parameters.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.70,0:57:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得去…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to have to go and...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.95,0:57:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 得改回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we need to change them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.60,0:57:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,阿曼达 把修改记录交给凯尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amanda, can we get that note over to Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.95,0:57:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 我觉得你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Absolutely. - Look, I think you're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.38,0:57:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只是我们可能不… - 我等不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I just don't think we want to... - I'm tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.70,0:57:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,卡鲁尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kalloor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.45,0:57:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.55,0:57:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,卡鲁尔先生 我是约翰·布罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kalloor, my name is John Burroughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.22,0:57:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,来自美国司法部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm from the Department of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.97,0:57:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我向您出示由美国政府颁发的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hereby serving you with the enclosed complaint...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.10,0:57:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗 非得在大庭广众之下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? We have to do this in public?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.45,0:57:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这张指控书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Issued by the US government
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.56,0:58:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,指控深梦集团违反谢尔曼法案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}against Deep Dream Corporation for violation of the Sherman Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.73,0:58:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,该指控书要求您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This complaint requires you to
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.22,0:58:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,保留所有个人及公司财务记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}preserve all personal and corporate financial records
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.94,0:58:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,直到反托拉斯动议提交至联邦法庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pending antitrust motions to be filed in federal court.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.32,0:58:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.12,0:58:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是杜威干的 - 亚伦 这是在警告我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is Dewey. - Aaron, it's a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.75,0:58:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得好好考虑一下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And maybe we should think about
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.90,0:58:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,趁事态还没恶化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what we're doing before it gets any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.88,0:58:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得满足了他 就万事大吉了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you think if we give him what he wants, it'll end there?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.26,0:58:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说也许我们该倾听一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm just saying that maybe we should listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.47,0:58:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,调出我跟杜威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to pull up all the
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.00,0:58:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的会面记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}records of all the meetings I've ever had with Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.35,0:58:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所有记录 私下的讨论也包括吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the records? Even the off-the-books discussions?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.56,0:58:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially those.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.94,0:58:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去维加斯 我需要保险措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to Vegas. I need an insurance policy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.15,1:00:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你在伦敦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you in London?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.74,1:00:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.86,1:00:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么派她来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you sending her?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.45,1:00:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她有她的用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She serves a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.20,1:00:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个人行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.50,1:00:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这次不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.75,1:00:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,别搞成私人恩怨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make this personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.67,1:00:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩背叛了我们 当然是私人恩怨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne betrayed us. It's always been personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.38,1:00:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道自己面对的是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.97,1:00:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better make sure you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.60,1:00:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,深梦有些事你得知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something you should know about Deep Dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.40,1:00:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但你得保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I need an assurance
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.15,1:00:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是支持我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I have your support.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.24,1:01:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it. What do you have?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.03,1:01:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,卡鲁尔在维加斯有计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kalloor is planning something for Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.00,1:01:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哪位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.10,1:01:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.15,1:01:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.50,1:01:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,谈什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.85,1:01:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经不为中情局工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't work for the Agency anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.67,1:02:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,帕丁顿广场 15分钟后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paddington Plaza, 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.92,1:02:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩刚给史密斯打电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne just called Smith.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.71,1:02:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在帕丁顿广场见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're meeting at Paddington Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.42,1:02:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,15分钟后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.17,1:02:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会全程跟踪史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll tail Smith the whole way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.96,1:02:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看到伯恩之后 我就接近他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as we get eyes on Bourne, I'll approach him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.05,1:02:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不管做什么 尽量收敛点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you do, stay contained.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.47,1:02:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想惊动英国人 问东问西的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want the Brits crawling all over us, asking questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.85,1:02:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.48,1:02:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,追踪设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracking device.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.73,1:03:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你守住桥的南侧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll hold on the south side of the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.95,1:03:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有需要我就联系你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll contact you if I need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.16,1:03:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.57,1:03:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你说了算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the boss, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.77,1:03:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,目标在移动 前往运河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subject is on the move. Heading toward the canal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.40,1:03:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A组 跟他平行前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha Team, take a parallel track.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.74,1:03:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,B组 在后面跟着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo Team, follow the subject from behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.03,1:03:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,留意伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And keep your eyes open for Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.20,1:03:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,B组正在跟踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo Team tailing subject.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.92,1:03:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.35,1:04:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,200米后右转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 200 meters, make a right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.00,1:04:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.34,1:04:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,通讯检查 第二频道 收到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Comms check. Second channel. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.93,1:04:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 你在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have you. Where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.43,1:04:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,朝史密斯前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heading towards Smith.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.44,1:04:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没看到伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.73,1:05:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,目标向东拐了 进了巷子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subject has turned east, into an alley.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.40,1:05:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A组 巷子通向一座桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha Team, that alley leads to a footbridge,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.56,1:05:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,目标会径直走向你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which will bring him to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.60,1:05:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.87,1:05:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,B组失去联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo Team is down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.46,1:05:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,正在发送新路线给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sending you updated route now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.75,1:05:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,收到没有 史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You copy that, Smith?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.63,1:05:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.90,1:05:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,B组 怎么不动 什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo Team, why aren't you moving? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.95,1:05:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,B组 收到没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo Team, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.49,1:05:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 希瑟 B组呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening, Heather? Where's Bravo?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.83,1:05:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,B组失去联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're comms down on Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.58,1:06:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A组 是否看到目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha Team, do you have eyes on the subject?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.80,1:06:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,能看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have eyes on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.55,1:06:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A组 报告情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha Team, sit-rep.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.64,1:06:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A组 报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha Team, report.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.31,1:06:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况 希瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening, Heather?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.07,1:06:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A组没有回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha Team isn't responding.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.73,1:06:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,B组呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.40,1:06:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.70,1:06:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,两个组都失联了？别搞砸了 希瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost both teams? Get a grip on this operation, Heather.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.03,1:06:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.49,1:06:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,让特工行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green-light the Asset.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.78,1:06:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我需要更多时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I need more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.33,1:06:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.04,1:06:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你下不下命令？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going to give that order or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.12,1:06:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.58,1:06:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你太天真了 看不清真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are too naive to see the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.59,1:06:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,根本不可能把伯恩带回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no bringing in Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.21,1:06:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,必须除掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has to be put down,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.42,1:06:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,而你很明显 没这个决断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you obviously cannot do what has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.26,1:06:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我来接手行动指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am taking operational control.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.72,1:06:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,特工 可以行动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asset, you have a green light.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.64,1:07:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 可以除掉伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat, you have a green light on Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.56,1:07:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.73,1:07:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.19,1:07:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,特工 你行动了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asset, are you on the move?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.57,1:07:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,特工 你的追踪设备显示你没在动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asset, your tracking device says you're stationary.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.70,1:07:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你行动了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you moving?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.12,1:07:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,希瑟 别说话 让他干活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather, stay off this channel. Let him do his job.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.63,1:07:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.88,1:07:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快去帕丁顿广场 - 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get to Paddington Plaza, fast. - Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.26,1:08:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In position.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.43,1:08:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,已锁定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locked in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.75,1:08:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.00,1:08:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that noise?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.37,1:08:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,多处火警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Multiple fire alarms.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.65,1:08:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是伯恩干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.59,1:08:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.13,1:09:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,原地不动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay there. You do not move.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.81,1:09:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,请由最近的出口离开大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave the building by the nearest available exit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.19,1:09:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.65,1:09:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你们保护不了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't protect me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.11,1:09:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你留在原地 史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to stay where you are, Smith.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.45,1:09:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你还能看到他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still have line of sight?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.91,1:09:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我看着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.28,1:09:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要在人群之中 他在我身边时射杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna shoot him in a crowd when he's right next to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.91,1:09:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,留在原地 史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay where you are, Smith.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.75,1:09:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他为什么会找来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why he's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.54,1:09:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他想要答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants answers.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.96,1:09:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经失去控制了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've lost this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.96,1:09:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我得离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.51,1:09:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.90,1:09:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.40,1:09:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩抓到史密斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne's got Smith.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.88,1:10:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,追上他们 我绕过去截住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go after them. I'll come around and cut them off.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.34,1:10:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,史密斯 我们知道你和伯恩在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smith, we know you're with Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.60,1:10:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你得想办法告诉我们 你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to find a way to let us know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.77,1:10:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么带我来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you taking me in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.73,1:10:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定在广场附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got to be near the Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.82,1:10:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, Bourne!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.72,1:10:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.53,1:10:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干什么 别激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.49,1:10:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,理查德·韦伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richard Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.74,1:10:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,贝鲁特分站站长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Station Chief, Beirut.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.62,1:10:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我父亲 他创立了踏脚石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was my father. He started Treadstone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.37,1:10:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他让你监控我 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hired you to put me under surveillance. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.75,1:10:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 他为什么雇了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jesus! - Why did he hire you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.63,1:10:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都别说 史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say anything, Smith.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.21,1:10:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.20,1:11:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no sign of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.60,1:11:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want us to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.68,1:11:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,沿着运河搜索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Work your way down the canal.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.39,1:11:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我绕过去跟你们汇合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll circle around and meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.56,1:11:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟踪我去了贝鲁特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You followed me to Beirut.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.90,1:11:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我最后一次见到我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last time I saw my father!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.24,1:11:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么要你跟踪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would he have you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.20,1:11:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这说不通 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't make any sense. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.20,1:11:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都别告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't give him a goddamn thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.87,1:11:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.75,1:11:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 伯恩 我要掉下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ, Bourne! I'm falling!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.15,1:11:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩 别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.59,1:11:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can hear them!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.51,1:11:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,贝鲁特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beirut.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.95,1:11:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我去是想告诉他 踏脚石来找我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went there to tell him that Treadstone had approached me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.22,1:11:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果是他创立的计划 他为什么没和我提过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if it was his program, why didn't he say anything to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.39,1:11:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've done something.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.69,1:11:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.77,1:11:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,要付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that came at a cost.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.61,1:12:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是在那天被杀死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the day he was killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.15,1:12:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,官方说他是被恐怖分子杀死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said he was killed by terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.50,1:12:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但其实不是恐怖分子 对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't killed by terrorists, was he?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.00,1:12:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,想想你家人的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about your family's safety,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.90,1:12:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,史密斯 什么都别说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smith. You keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.62,1:12:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,下一枪我会打死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next bullet's in your head!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.21,1:12:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么会被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why was he killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.50,1:12:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.20,1:12:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他是因为你才被杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was killed because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.40,1:12:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲 他没参与行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father, he wasn't in Operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.60,1:12:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他不知道我们选中了你 等他发现后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't know we'd chosen you. When he found out, he...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.80,1:12:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他威胁要把计划曝光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He threatened to expose the program.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.85,1:12:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他不想让你变成杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't want you turned into a killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.45,1:12:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,谁杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who killed him?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.62,1:12:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,谁杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who killed him?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.87,1:12:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.25,1:13:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.25,1:13:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他就要到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.60,1:13:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要彻底解决这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna stop this now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.14,1:13:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,别 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.37,1:13:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 快叫救护车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody help! Call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.12,1:13:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.08,1:13:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他从楼顶摔下去了 五楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went off the roof. Five floors.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.33,1:13:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他认出我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He recognized me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.25,1:13:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我去确认收尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to make sure it's finished.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.76,1:13:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就有人来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help's coming now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.55,1:13:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,别起来 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, don't get up, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.39,1:13:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,请让开 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step aside, please. Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.52,1:13:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,都退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody step back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.93,1:13:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我们做事 - 退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let us do our job. - Please step back.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.90,1:14:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,有谁看见事情经过了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did anybody see what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.11,1:14:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.19,1:14:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 我去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, shit. - I'm going after him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.19,1:14:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,顺着运河找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll work my way down the canal.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.74,1:14:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不 伦敦没你的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You're done in London.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.91,1:14:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.45,1:14:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有其他任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's another play to be made.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.70,1:14:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道我们做了什么 他会来找我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that he knows what we did, he'll come for both of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.29,1:14:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那也许是办成另一件事的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that could be the opportunity for something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.71,1:14:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是让你复仇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't about revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.50,1:14:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.90,1:14:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不是他死就是我亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it won't be done until one of us is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.88,1:14:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,去机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.92,1:14:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,铁手行动出问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a problem with Iron Hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.05,1:14:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.73,1:14:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,报告情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a sit-rep.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.06,1:14:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,目前还没动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.69,1:14:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,继续观察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.95,1:14:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.75,1:15:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,情况不该成这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't supposed to go like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.08,1:15:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.25,1:15:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,杜威去哪里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Dewey going?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.88,1:15:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他去维加斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to Vegas to speak
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.48,1:15:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,去一个网络展会见亚伦·卡鲁尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with Aaron Kalloor at a cyber convention.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.93,1:15:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,中情局每年都会在那里招人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Agency recruits there every year.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.76,1:15:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,什么是铁手行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's Iron Hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.77,1:15:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,杜威新创立的秘密行动计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dewey's new black-ops program.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.23,1:15:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,全方位监控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full-spectrum surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.36,1:15:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,随时随地监控每一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watching everyone all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.02,1:15:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,杜威需要卡鲁尔的合作 才能上线运行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dewey needs Kalloor's cooperation to bring it online.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.85,1:15:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我要下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.91,1:15:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can help you get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.50,1:15:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.75,1:15:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你我虽然理由不同 但都是要除掉杜威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I have different reasons, but we both want Dewey gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.84,1:15:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,给 拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.44,1:16:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,维加斯见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you in Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.17,1:16:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.30,1:16:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们准备将卡鲁尔遇刺一事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're pinning Kalloor's hit
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.65,1:16:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嫁祸给一个虚构的圣战分子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on a fictional jihadi shooter.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.10,1:16:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一个20岁的伊拉克人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A 20-year-old Iraqi national.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.26,1:16:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们伪造了银行账户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We created bank accounts,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.44,1:16:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,旅行文件 电子邮件和电话记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}travel documents, e-mails, phone records.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.35,1:16:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,让他看起来像是单干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll look like a lone wolf.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.60,1:16:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有实际证据吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any physical evidence?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.94,1:16:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,特工会留下枪 枪上会有伊拉克人的指纹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Asset leaves the gun. It'll have the Iraqi's prints on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.69,1:16:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事不需要让拉塞尔知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Russell doesn't need to know about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.53,1:16:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.03,1:17:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有伯恩的消息吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any news on Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.04,1:17:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.12,1:17:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定会来找我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was always gonna come for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.92,1:17:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他来了 我们会处理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if it happens, we'll deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.04,1:17:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么去伦敦 迈克尔斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was the purpose of your visit to London, Mr. Michaels?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.88,1:17:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,商务访问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Business.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.61,1:18:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.45,1:18:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.92,1:18:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,停车场安全 可以进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parking lot clear. You're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.14,1:18:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 楼上已经安排好了房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we have a secure room for you, right upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.03,1:19:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝您入住愉快 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Enjoy your stay. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.04,1:19:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎入住阿丽雅酒店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, welcome to the Aria.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.66,1:19:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 希瑟·李 开个房间 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heather Lee, checking in. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.17,1:20:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,给您安排了天空套房 房间号2016\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have you in a lovely Sky Suite. Number 2016.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.72,1:20:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,祝您入住愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy your stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.89,1:20:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.89,1:20:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,亚伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaron!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.23,1:20:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 亚伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Aaron!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.57,1:20:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,深梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deep Dream!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.58,1:20:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,联系李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find Lee.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.58,1:20:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉她 我上台前要见她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell her I want to see her before we go on stage.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.92,1:20:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.34,1:20:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在后台和观众席都要安排特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want agents posted backstage as well as the auditorium.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.75,1:20:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.77,1:20:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,让一让 让让\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming through, make a hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.77,1:20:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,让让 让让\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make a hole, make a hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.94,1:20:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这里停一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna make a quick stop here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.40,1:21:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好 我是亚伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys. Hi. How's it going? Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.11,1:21:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.74,1:21:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可以给我一个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I get one?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.36,1:21:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们的辛勤工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks very much for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.04,1:21:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.20,1:21:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干得很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing a great job.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.49,1:21:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.74,1:21:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all set?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.35,1:21:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,正在查看撤离路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Checking the departure route now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.41,1:21:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你的时间不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.74,1:21:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不知道我在哪里 时间足够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't know where it came from. I'll have enough time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.29,1:21:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,解决掉卡鲁尔之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you take care of Kalloor,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.52,1:22:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我会站在旁边 往我的左手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be standing, left hand at my side.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.17,1:22:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你打上一枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You put a bullet in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.34,1:22:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是目标会比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's better if I'm a target, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.51,1:22:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.60,1:22:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.05,1:22:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,局长上台前要见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Director wants a word before you go on stage.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.55,1:22:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.58,1:23:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,证件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ID?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.16,1:23:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.00,1:23:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,希瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heather.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.77,1:23:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我的门生 最坚定的支持者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My protégé. Strongest supporter.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.11,1:23:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 伦敦那事之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, after what happened in London,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.84,1:23:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么处置你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not know what to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.45,1:23:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我想就把它当成是 你学习的过程吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose we'll just, um, write it off to your learning curve.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.12,1:24:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.79,1:24:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,至少你现在知道 你其实一点机会都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least you can now see that you never had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.25,1:24:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等伯恩再次出现 由我来解决他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Bourne turns up again, I'll deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.13,1:24:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.80,1:24:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.47,1:24:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree completely.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.97,1:24:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们上台之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we get on stage,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.25,1:24:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,政策问题我来回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll handle all the policy questions,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.11,1:24:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,技术问题你来回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}throw everything technical to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.56,1:24:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.73,1:24:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.90,1:24:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有徽章吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Badges?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.85,1:24:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,亚伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.34,1:24:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robert.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.18,1:24:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识希瑟·李吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know Heather Lee.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.60,1:25:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我们在斯坦福是同学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we went to Stanford together.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.56,1:25:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你在中情局感觉如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. How are you enjoying life at the Agency?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.40,1:25:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很有挑战 也很充实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Challenging. But fulfilling.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.82,1:25:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里还能坚守原则吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's tough to stay true to your principles over there?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.20,1:25:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 谢谢关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My principles are just fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.87,1:25:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,先生们 准备好了 请跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, we're ready for you. Follow me, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.65,1:25:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我会享受舞台的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.62,1:25:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.72,1:25:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.41,1:26:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,大家晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Hi! How's everybody doing tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.70,1:26:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.75,1:26:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.59,1:26:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到今晚的EXOCON研讨会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to tonight's EXOCON Symposium.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.59,1:26:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我们有幸 请来了四位尊贵的客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are so lucky to have four fantastic guests this evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.15,1:26:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,中情局局长 罗伯特·杜威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The CIA Director, Robert Dewey, is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.80,1:26:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,以及我的好朋友 EXOCON的老朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a dear friend of mine, and an old friend of EXOCON,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.27,1:26:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,社交媒体巨头 深梦的首席执行官亚伦·卡鲁尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the CEO of social-media giant Deep Dream, Aaron Kalloor is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.27,1:27:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚 自由因特网的监管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight, "Policing a free Internet,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.90,1:27:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,个人权利和公共安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Personal rights versus public safety."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.15,1:27:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的时代面临的严峻问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the great question of our time.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.69,1:27:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们的决定也影响着我们的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the choices we make about this will determine our future.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.28,1:27:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's just dive right in, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.62,1:27:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,上来吧 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on out here, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.49,1:27:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 有一条信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, you've got an incoming message.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.96,1:27:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,优先级很高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High priority.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.17,1:27:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我得先处理这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, guys, I'm gonna have to take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.88,1:27:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我迟点上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll catch up with you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.09,1:27:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们先请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.14,1:27:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们的邀请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for having me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.53,1:28:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎杜威局长临时有事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears Director Dewey is held up momentarily,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.03,1:28:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不会耽搁太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I am being told that it shouldn't be too much longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.66,1:28:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是今晚 我们会有许多安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we have a ton of stuff to get into tonight,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.32,1:28:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们可以先行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we can start anyway...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.57,1:28:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,布拉德 布拉德 我可以说两句吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brad? Brad, could I say a few words?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.79,1:28:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 我可以说两句吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me? - Can I get the ball rolling?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.66,1:28:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 女士们先生们 亚伦·卡鲁尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sure, man, by all means. Ladies and gentlemen, Aaron Kalloor.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.89,1:28:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.22,1:28:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢 布拉德和EXOCON的伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks a lot to Brad and all the folks at EXOCON
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.64,1:28:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,再次邀请我们 也谢谢你们能前来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for having us back, and to you guys for turning out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.23,1:28:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在局长来之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before the Director comes out to join us,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.90,1:28:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我想能先和你们聊几句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted to share a few words with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.86,1:28:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很久之前 我有个想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A long time ago, I had this idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.65,1:28:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 美好的想法 创造一个空间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Copy that. - A beautiful idea, to create a place, online...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.32,1:28:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,面部识别有结果了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Facial recognition got a hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.83,1:28:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩乘英国航空公司的飞机 从希斯罗机场出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne was on a BA flight from Heathrow to Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.95,1:28:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,两小时前抵达了维加斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It landed two hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.50,1:28:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么通过入境检查的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did he get through immigration?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.71,1:28:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有人给他的护照 授予了中情局安全权限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone issued him an Agency security clearance on his passport.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.67,1:29:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,结果是一个非常受欢迎的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it turned out to be a pretty popular idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.09,1:29:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,全世界的人们 开始使用我们的服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People from around the world started using our service.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.81,1:29:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 这让我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, first off, this has all
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.35,1:29:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,富有 但不健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}made me a lot more rich than is probably healthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.07,1:29:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我上台之后 解决卡鲁尔和那个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I come on stage, take care of Kalloor and the girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.78,1:29:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.53,1:29:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我要说的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, what I mean to say is that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.12,1:29:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,成功有其代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all this success has come at a cost.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.87,1:29:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,深梦的核心得了绝症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a cancer at the heart of Deep Dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.00,1:29:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,一个让我非常内疚的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A guilty secret, and, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.21,1:29:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须告诉你们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to share it with all of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.84,1:29:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这个混蛋要搞垮我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch is about to take us down.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.24,1:29:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻解决卡鲁尔和那个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take out Kalloor and the girl right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.81,1:29:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别动 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay there. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.81,1:29:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,在我创业初期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was starting out, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.98,1:30:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,为了让公司起步 我收了钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took money to start my company.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.98,1:30:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,和魔鬼做了交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Made a bargain with a guy in a dark suit...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.11,1:30:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在想要拿走我的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now he's come back to take my soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.46,1:30:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,枪手在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see the shooter!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.50,1:30:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看到杰森·伯恩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got eyes on Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.67,1:30:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着 叫救护车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still breathing. Call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.34,1:30:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.63,1:30:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 长官 我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go! - Sir, we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.36,1:30:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,去出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head for the exit!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.94,1:30:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我是瓦斯科斯 我们看到伯恩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Vasquez. We're on Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.86,1:30:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,去把车准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the cars ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.36,1:30:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快去把车准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the cars ready right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.49,1:30:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,送我回房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, take me to the suite.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.87,1:30:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我们得带你离开 伯恩在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we've got to get you out of here. Bourne is on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.20,1:30:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到了 送我回房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard me. Take me to the suite.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.50,1:31:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.62,1:31:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,送他回房间 送他上楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him to the suite. Take him upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.71,1:31:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,送他上楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.88,1:31:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快 赶快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.21,1:31:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,上楼去房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up to the suite.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.88,1:31:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们走 快 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go, right now. Go, go, go! - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.59,1:31:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这边走 这边走 别紧张 这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come this way. This way. Don't worry. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.76,1:31:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,别挡路 联邦探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the way! Federal agent!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.73,1:31:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦斯科斯 报告情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vasquez, sit-rep.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.94,1:31:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦斯科斯 回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vasquez, come in!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.72,1:31:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,找到他了 长官 我是科里尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we've got him. Sir, this is Collier.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.01,1:31:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们找到狙击手了 - 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've ID'd the sniper. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.10,1:31:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在分发他的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're circulating his photo now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.77,1:32:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.23,1:32:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.31,1:32:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩刚刚离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Bourne is just leaving
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.57,1:32:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,西边的应急通道 往大堂去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the west service corridor, heading for the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.90,1:32:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,明白 盯住伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that. Stay on Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.28,1:32:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.44,1:32:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还在寻找伯恩 他们发现特工了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still looking for Bourne. And they've ID'd the Asset.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.88,1:32:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,回一楼去 等候进一步通知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to the first floor and wait for further instructions.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.13,1:32:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 明白 - 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir. Copy that. - Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.86,1:32:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,都趴下 快趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody down! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.24,1:32:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下 让开 让开 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down, move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.16,1:33:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,别挡路 联邦特工 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the way! Federal agents! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.18,1:33:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,带一队人从东北部的电梯上去 到楼上汇合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a team to the northeast elevators. I'll meet you up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.82,1:33:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,伯恩上去找你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne's on his way up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.50,1:34:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你来的时间有点长 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took a long time to get here, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.25,1:34:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道贝鲁特的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know about Beirut.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.75,1:34:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们干了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.80,1:34:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚一切都将结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It all ends tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.01,1:34:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,直接动手会更简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be a lot easier to do it right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.85,1:34:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你来不是为了复仇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't come here for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.60,1:34:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你来是因为你知道 该回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came here because you know it's time to come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.32,1:35:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲创立了这个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father created the program.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.99,1:35:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,却没本事完成这个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't have what it takes to make it work.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.78,1:35:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但你有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.08,1:35:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always did.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.87,1:35:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才会自愿报名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.54,1:35:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为我以为 他是被我们的敌人杀死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I volunteered because I thought our enemies killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.05,1:35:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我因为一个谎言而自愿报名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I volunteered because of a lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.72,1:35:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你自愿报名是出于你的自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you volunteered because of who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.63,1:35:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你就是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You volunteered because you are Jason Bourne,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.97,1:35:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是大卫·韦伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not David Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.40,1:35:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了三十二个人 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-two kills, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.48,1:35:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,每杀死一个人 都让这个世界改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every one of them made a difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.32,1:35:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这个国家的国民 因为你而更加安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People all across this country are safer because of what you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.00,1:35:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我在寻找另一种方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to find another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.09,1:36:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那你找到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how's that working out for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.10,1:36:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远都无法找到内心的平静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're never going to find any peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.73,1:36:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,直到你承认自己究竟是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not until you admit to yourself who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.19,1:36:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候回来了 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to come in, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.95,1:36:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你该回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.00,1:36:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.55,1:36:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,至少不能为了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.33,1:37:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你没来过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were never here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.72,1:37:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to go after him.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.51,1:37:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就可以结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can stop now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.10,1:37:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以做出选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.54,1:37:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 请拿出你们的身份证件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go! - Have your IDs ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.42,1:38:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,拿出你们的身份证件 先生们女士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have your IDs ready, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.13,1:38:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,拿出你们的身份证件 这边 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have your IDs ready! Come on, guys, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.81,1:38:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,排队走 拉斯维加斯警察 女士们先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand in a line. Las Vegas Police, ladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.27,1:39:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一辆特警装甲车和无牌黑色道奇冲锋者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}BearCat SWAT truck and unmarked black Dodge Charger
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.19,1:39:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在阿丽雅酒店门口被盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stolen from the front of the Aria.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.78,1:39:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,正在追踪 请求空中支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pursuit in progress. Air support requested.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.99,1:39:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that ID?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.08,1:43:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,拦下他 把路口堵起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop him! Block that road!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.08,1:43:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.29,1:43:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.71,1:43:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move out!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.84,1:44:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.18,1:44:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,两个单位追踪中 请确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next two units involved, identify.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.35,1:44:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是空中1号 请注意 疑犯车辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Air 1. Be advised, suspect vehicles
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.98,1:44:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,撞进了里维埃拉酒店东南入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have crashed into the southeast entrance of the Riviera.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.57,1:44:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一名武装疑犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an armed suspect
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.66,1:44:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,正在走进里维埃拉酒店南边的雨水管道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}heading into the storm drain south of the Riviera.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.77,1:46:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个叛徒 一直都是个叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a traitor. You've always been a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.48,1:46:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,骨子里就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in your blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.90,1:48:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,卡鲁尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kalloor!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.91,1:48:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,亚伦 你在大会上想跟大家说的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaron! What were you going to tell everyone at the convention?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.57,1:48:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你在隐瞒些什么 亚伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you hiding, Aaron?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.61,1:48:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么有人会想暗杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did somebody try to assassinate you?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.04,1:48:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,深梦核心的绝症究竟是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the cancer at the heart of Deep Dream?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.37,1:48:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为在这个时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it would be
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.08,1:48:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,做出任何评论都很不合适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inappropriate to pass any comment at this stage,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.96,1:48:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但我很期待和当局合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I look forward to working with the authorities
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.96,1:48:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,查明谁敢对此事负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to find out who was responsible.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.63,1:48:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,至于深梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to getting back to Deep Dream,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.92,1:48:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将继续我们重要的工作 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where we can continue our important work. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.09,1:48:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有欺骗你的用户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you been lying to your users?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.71,1:49:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.76,1:49:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说我很抱歉 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to say I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.35,1:49:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,关于维加斯的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.18,1:49:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,杜威局长的做法并不明智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Director Dewey's tactics were unwise.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.02,1:49:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不明智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unwise?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.27,1:49:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还在想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still trying to come
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.27,1:49:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对外解释到底发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}up with a narrative to explain what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.53,1:49:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋把铁手行动暴露在聚光灯下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That son of a bitch put a spotlight on Iron Hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.28,1:49:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们全都暴露了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.91,1:49:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,卡鲁尔还没有对外说任何东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kalloor hasn't gone public yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.74,1:49:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解亚伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.08,1:49:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有其他办法可以和他周旋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are still moves we can make with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.29,1:49:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,说说看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.13,1:49:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,杜威的问题在于 他属于过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dewey's problem was that he belonged in the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.68,1:49:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,而卡鲁尔这样的人 正在塑造未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People like Kalloor are shaping the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.64,1:50:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解这种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are my people.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.43,1:50:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么应付他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how to deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.52,1:50:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.36,1:50:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你指派新的中情局局长时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you appoint a new Agency Director,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.36,1:50:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你会希望他能听你的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're going to need someone working for your interests.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.49,1:50:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一个由你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.82,1:50:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,授权之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}empowered by you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.66,1:50:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那伯恩呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.25,1:50:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是觉得 能把他带回来么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still think you can bring him in?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.29,1:50:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have his trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.71,1:50:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我们经历了那么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After what we went through.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.97,1:50:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我会带他回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.47,1:50:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我有信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.56,1:50:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你做不到呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you can't?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.02,1:50:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那就只能干掉他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he'll have to be put down.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.40,1:50:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这个提议很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an interesting proposal.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.62,1:51:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以停车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can pull over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.87,1:51:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 如果你认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, if you decide that
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.64,1:51:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你不需要我 那就没问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you don't need me, then that's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.04,1:51:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有许多机构会想知道我掌握的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are many other agencies who would want what I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.95,1:51:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我带了东西给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.08,1:51:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你父亲在兰利纪念墙上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a cast from your father's star,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.25,1:51:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,银星的仿制品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the Memorial Wall at Langley.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.47,1:52:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,关于你的遭遇 我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry for what happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.14,1:52:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,包括局里人是怎么对你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you were treated.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.65,1:52:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但是那些人都走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the people that did that are gone,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.36,1:52:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,局里的局面已经和往日不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and things are changing at the Agency.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.99,1:52:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.91,1:52:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是个爱国者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you've always been a patriot.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.54,1:52:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在乎这个国家经历着什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That what happens to this country matters to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.87,1:52:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要你帮忙保护我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you to help protect us.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.46,1:52:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,回来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.92,1:52:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll work together.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.64,1:52:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,让我想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.39,1:52:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要怎么找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How will I find you?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.32,1:53:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是觉得 你能把他带回来么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still think you can bring him in?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.57,1:53:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have his trust.
